# Orqis (always)

**Read first:** `knowledge-base/INDEX.md` → `knowledge-base/invariants.md`

**Before code:** `knowledge-base/graph/dependencies.yaml` (node for what you touch) + `CHANGE_IMPACT.md`

**Detail on demand:** `knowledge-base/schemas/` · `knowledge-base/apis/` · `knowledge-base/features/Fxx-*.md`

**After ship:** feature file + INDEX row + changelog + `dependencies.yaml` if coupling changed

**PR:** `make validate-graph` · [`CONTRIBUTING.md`](../../CONTRIBUTING.md)

**Archive only:** `scrap/` — not for implementation

**MVP:** Celery+Redis for runs · Arango metadata · no external agent onboarding · no no-code builder unless asked
